For Gradle projects: compile group: 'com.epam.healenium', name: 'healenium-web', version: '3.5.8' (use implementation instead of compile since you're on modern Gradle). 
GitHub
Step 3: Create the healenium.properties file
Create a file at src/test/resources/healenium.properties with:
properties
recovery-tries=1
score-cap=0.5
heal-enabled=true
hlm.server.url=http://localhost:7878
hlm.imitator.url=http://localhost:8000
recovery-tries is the number of times the algorithm will try to discover a matched locator. score-cap is the minimum matching score required for the detected locator to be accepted (50% is represented by 0.5). heal-enabled is a toggle switch that turns healing on or off.
